Package: acer-control-center
Version: 1.3.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: ZarXD <you@example.com>
Description: Native Linux replacement for Acer Control Center.
 Provides fan, performance profile, keyboard backlight and battery controls.
Depends: libc6, libgl1, libegl1, libx11-6, libxcursor1, libxrandr2, libxi6, libxkbcommon0, libwayland-client0, libwayland-cursor0, libwayland-egl1
Recommends: desktop-file-utils, hicolor-icon-theme
